OL,3,GNEWSAMan shot in Digbeth charged with
OL,4,Aviolent disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who suffered a gunshot wound to
OL,7,Fthe leg during an incident in
OL,8,FBirmingham has been charged with
OL,9,Fviolent disorder.
OL,11,FKeon Knowles, 23, was taken to hospital
OL,12,Fafter the incident which police said
OL,13,Fstarted inside the Luna Springs venue
OL,14,Fin Digbeth on Sunday night.
OL,16,FIt is then thought to have spilled out
OL,17,Fonto the street at the corner of Hack
OL,18,FStreet and Bromley Street, at around
OL,19,F11:20 BST.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
