OL,4,Aviolent disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnowles was arrested in hospital before
OL,7,Fbeing released into police custody on
OL,8,FTuesday. On Wednesday, he was charged
OL,9,Fwith possession of a firearm with
OL,10,Fintent to endanger life and violent
OL,11,Fdisorder.
